WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.100
A controlled local browser starts a bare subscription turn.
The fictional task is a workshop opening checklist.

00:02.100 --> 00:04.100
The browser begins receiving the answer, then closes
its actual response stream after 23 characters.

00:04.100 --> 00:10.700
The browser's partial answer freezes.
The same engine process continues the turn.

00:10.700 --> 00:13.600
The engine completes the answer and stores
all 2,632 characters in the isolated Redis instance.

00:13.600 --> 00:18.150
The browser retrieves the stored answer with HTTP 200.
A second read returns the same result.
